{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/38829-ways-to-justify-surviving-child-wraiths-surviving","id":38829,"title":"Ways to justify surviving child wraiths surviving?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Wraith: The Oblivion"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-12-29T12:43:16-08:00","id":38829,"title":"Ways to justify surviving child wraiths surviving?","content":"Found a note in the Striplings article on white wolfs wiki that just &quot;Feels&quot; cannonical, way its phrased, saying that the hierchy, has decreed that child wraiths should be smelted ASAP after their reaping.<br /> <br /> Any ideas on how to justify some surviving, especialy in Hierchy influenced lands?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-29T14:14:28-08:00","id":38874,"title":"","content":"Maybe if the child reminded one of the higher-ups of someone they held dear (like a child they had when they were alive) could be a reason for some strings to be pulled. Or a more sympathetic member could hide a few..","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my DriveThruRPG books at: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Carrie%20Kube\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....=Carrie%20Kube</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1834-yaoi-huntress-earth","name":"Yaoi Huntress Earth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1834_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"535"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-29T14:41:49-08:00","id":38891,"title":"","content":"Like pretty much any Hierarchy law, it will be ignored at the convenience at the whims of whoever is there. The article you seem to be talking about notes that some slip through anyway. The easiest reason is the most basic: Wraiths are trying to hold on to being human on some level. Humans don't just slaughter children for being weak. The rationale of the Hierarchy's law on the subject is obvious and logical and compelling. But that doesn't matter when you're staring at the ghost of a dead child - confused and alone and terrified - who seems to be coping with their Shadow as well as any other new Wraith would. Emotions are going to all say, &quot;this one can make it if you just protect it.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-29T16:04:43-08:00","id":38940,"title":"","content":"True, I also think that if any relatives of theirs, are currently in the underworld, like a parent or grandparent, especialy if they've achieved any status, its probaly not worth creating an enemy, just to prevent one possible stripling.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-30T13:52:55-08:00","id":39567,"title":"","content":"Honestly I think the best way is for the child Wraith to be less of the stereotypical child and more....one of the weird ones. Those who may act older or be particularly bright. Luck could factor in, or even being a member of a renegade faction. The problem is that children are emotionally volatile and therefore most likely to fall to their shadow and become a spectre/stripling. Sad....but yeah...its one of the more challenging areas I think.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1559-cryocube","name":"cryocube","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1559_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}